            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Points: Spotify Top 50 PH #1 = 100 ... #50 = 2; Viral Hits PH and Billboard PH Hot 100 #1 = 100 ... #100 = 1; added up over the three lists. TikTok: each title searched on TikTok every 3 days, videos summed over the song''s sounds'"
