      "visualHeaderTooltip": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'#: Place in the OPM top 30 by list points (1 = most).\nSong: OPM song on Spotify''s Top 50 - Philippines, Viral Hits Philippines or the Billboard Philippines Hot 100 playlist (weekly).\nArtist: Main artist on Spotify. OPM = 90%+ of their top-city listeners are in the Philippines, or an NDN / Vic''s-list artist.\nList points: Top 50 PH #1 = 100 ... #50 = 2; Viral Hits PH and Billboard PH Hot 100 #1 = 100 ... #100 = 1; added up over the three lists (most = 300).\nTop 50 PH: Place on Spotify''s Top 50 - Philippines (daily chart playlist). Empty = not on it.\nViral Hits PH: Place on Spotify''s Viral Hits Philippines playlist. Empty = not on it.\nBillboard PH Hot 100: Place on the Billboard Philippines Hot 100 (a fan-made Spotify copy, updated weekly). Empty = not on it.\nTikTok videos so far: All TikTok videos using the song''s counted sounds: its official sound plus versions found by searching the title on TikTok (every 3 days).\nChange in 4 weeks: Growth of those TikTok videos over 4 weeks; +50% = half as many again. Empty until a count 6+ days earlier exists.\nSounds counted: TikTok sounds counted for the song: credited to the artist, or 2+ captions on the sound''s page name the artist.\nBiggest sound: The counted sound with the most videos (title / who uploaded it).\nOpen it: The biggest sound''s TikTok page.\nTo do: What is still missing for the song''s TikTok numbers.'"
                }
              }
            },
